{"id":"NJ-local_preemption-1","technology":"solar;wind;battery_storage","policy_type":"local_preemption","who_decides":null,"state_body":null,"threshold_mw":null,"summary":"Solar, wind and battery storage facilities on 10 or more contiguous acres under one owner are a permitted use in every industrial or commercial district, and solar and storage on rooftops, landfills, brownfields, contaminated sites, mining sites and closed extraction sites (wind on landfills and closed extraction sites outside the Pinelands) are a permitted use in every municipality.","statute_citation":"N.J. Stat. Ann. 40:55D-66.11; 40:55D-66.16 (P.L.2009, c.35; P.L.2011, c.141; as amended by P.L.2026, c.84)","statute_url":"https://pub.njleg.state.nj.us/Bills/2026/S3500/3183_R3.HTM","evidence_level":"primary_source","verification":"verified","reviewed_on":"2026-10-09"},
{"id":"NJ-other-1","technology":"solar","policy_type":"other","who_decides":"state_board","state_body":"New Jersey Pinelands Commission","threshold_mw":null,"summary":"In the Pinelands Preservation Area, Special Agricultural Production Area and Forest Areas, solar facilities as a principal use are allowed only on closed landfills, remediated contaminated sites or previously mined land, on previously disturbed portions, with Pinelands Development Credit purchases in many cases.","statute_citation":"N.J. Admin. Code 7:50-5.36","statute_url":"https://www.law.cornell.edu/regulations/new-jersey/N-J-A-C-7-50-5-36","evidence_level":"primary_source","verification":"verified","reviewed_on":"2026-10-09"},
{"id":"NJ-siting_authority-1","technology":"solar;wind;battery_storage","policy_type":"siting_authority","who_decides":"local_government","state_body":null,"threshold_mw":null,"summary":"New Jersey has no state siting permit for onshore solar or wind; municipalities decide under the Municipal Land Use Law, subject to state rules that make these facilities a permitted use on certain sites and to state environmental permits.","statute_citation":"N.J. Stat. Ann. 40:55D-1 et seq.; 40:55D-66.11; 40:55D-66.16","statute_url":"https://pub.njleg.state.nj.us/Bills/2026/S3500/3183_R3.HTM","evidence_level":"primary_source","verification":"verified","reviewed_on":"2026-10-09"}
